// Title: Suspicious Schtasks Execution AppData Folder
// ID: c5c00f49-b3f9-45a6-997e-cfdecc6e1967
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: pH-T (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-03-15
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1053.005, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects the creation of a schtask that executes a file from C:\Users\<USER>\AppData\Local
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.executable endswith "\\schtasks.exe" and (process.command_line like "*_/Create*" and process.command_line like "*_/RU*" and process.command_line like "*_/TR*" and process.command_line like "*_C:\\Users\\*" and process.command_line like "*_\\AppData\\Local\\*") and (process.command_line like "*_NT AUT*" or process.command_line like "*_ SYSTEM *")) and not (((process.parent.executable like "*_\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*" and process.parent.executable like "*_TeamViewer_.exe*") and process.executable endswith "\\schtasks.exe" and process.command_line like "*_/TN TVInstallRestore*")))
